<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		Ideology memes gain agreeable / disagreeable traits (and trait-driven opinion values) from Vanilla Traits Expanded, Big
		and Small, Alpha Memes, VIE Memes and Structures, VQE The Generator, Vanilla Cooking / Books / Genetics / Vehicles
		Expanded, ReSplice Charmweavers and Lost Factory Mechanoids content. Moved from the core root file ZZ1A_AgreeingMemes.xml
		(no setting). Removed 32 entries for Bundle of Traits (dani.moreTraits) and [LC] Consolidated Traits, both unsupported.
		Each block is gated on its mods; Vanilla Books Expanded is gated by packageId.
		Checked with analysis/patch_sim.py: all installed-mod ops apply.
	-->

